  data: {
    LLM: "Knock early. If you have two sets and your remaining 3 cards are an Ace-2-3, you have very low points (6). Knocking early prevents your opponent from finishing their high-value runs.\n\nThe 'High Card Dump': If you aren't close to a meld, discard your Kings and Queens first. Your goal is to keep your deadwood total low in case someone else knocks suddenly.\n\nBaiting the Discard: Discard a card that you think your opponent doesn't need, even if it fits your hypothetical run, to keep the stock pile moving without giving them an advantage.",
